  "content": "<h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">这个模组使所有类型的马铠和马鞍都可以制作。</span></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><hr><h3><strong>支持的版本：</strong></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li>1.20 [最新]&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>Forge</strong></span>&nbsp; |&nbsp; <span style=\"color:#36f\"><strong>Fabric</strong></span></li>\n<li>1.19 [最新]&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>Forge</strong></span>&nbsp; |&nbsp; <span style=\"color:#36f\"><strong>Fabric</strong></span></li>\n<li>1.18 [最新]&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>Forge</strong></span>&nbsp; |&nbsp; <span style=\"color:#00f\"><strong>Fabric</strong></span></li>\n<li>1.17 [最新]&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>Forge</strong>&nbsp;</span> |&nbsp; <span style=\"color:#00f\"><strong>Fabric</strong></span></li>\n<li>1.16 [最新]&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>Forge</strong>&nbsp; </span>|&nbsp; <span style=\"color:#00f\"><strong>Fabric</strong></span></li>\n<li>1.15 [最新]&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>Forge</strong>&nbsp; </span>|&nbsp; <span style=\"color:#00f\"><strong>Fabric</strong></span></li>\n<li>1.14 [最新]&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>Forge</strong>&nbsp;</span> |&nbsp; <span style=\"color:#00f\"><strong>Fabric</strong></span></li>\n<li>1.13 [不支持]</li>\n<li>1.12 [最新]&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>Forge</strong></span></li>\n<li>1.11 [最新]&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>Forge</strong></span></li>\n<li>1.10 [最新]&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>Forge</strong></span></li>\n<li>1.9&nbsp; &nbsp;[最新]&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>Forge</strong></span></li>\n<li>1.8&nbsp; &nbsp;[最新]&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>Forge</strong></span></li>\n<li>1.7&nbsp; &nbsp;[最新]&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>Forge</strong></span></li>\n</ul><h3><strong>保护：&nbsp;</strong></h3><p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/iCwQZy1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"234\" height=\"109\"></p><h3><strong>配方：</strong><br><em>对于 Minecraft 1.13 及以上版本，你只能使用白色羊毛来制作配方。</em></h3><p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/25T36Ji.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"502\" height=\"308\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/RHXA0EQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"502\" height=\"297\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yW94i5z.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"150\"></p>",
